# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked. ``meta/services.yml`` pins ``sso.enabled: false`` and ``logout.enabled: false``: Bridgy Fed has no local user table, no in-app authorisation tier, and no logout button, and placing it behind the SSO-proxy sidecar would break inbound federation traffic."
msgstr "Оба аутентифицированных персонажа драматурга заблокированы. ``meta/services.yml`` булавки ``sso.enabled: false`` и ``logout.enabled: false``: У Bridgy Fed нет локальной таблицы пользователей, нет уровня авторизации в приложении и кнопки выхода из системы, и размещение ее за боковым вагоном SSO-прокси нарушит входящий трафик федерации."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked. `meta/services.yml` pins `sso.enabled: false` and `logout.enabled: false`: Bridgy Fed has no local user table, no in-app authorisation tier, and no logout button, and placing it behind the SSO-proxy sidecar would break inbound federation traffic."
