# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright suite is split per login surface **and persona** (the runner globs every `*.js` under `files/playwright/`):"
msgstr "Комплект Playwright разделен на поверхность входа **и персона** (Бегущий глотает каждый `*.js` под `files/playwright/`):"

