# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "У вас нет родного SSO; сессия администратора отчеканена из oauth.2-заголовок прокси-идентификатора ``shunt_is_valid_user`` входить ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` Персона остается в живых и тренирует мост до конца."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), so `biber` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, and the denial is asserted explicitly by `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. The `administrator` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "У вас нет родного SSO; сессия администратора отчеканена из oauth.2-заголовок прокси-идентификатора `shunt_is_valid_user` входить [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), который почитает заголовок только на закрытом пути администратора и только для членов YOURLS Группа администраторов. Сами ворота признают только ту же группу RBAC. ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml))Так `biber` Отклоняется до YOURLS Выкладывает что угодно: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) объявлять `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, и отрицание явно утверждается `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. Это `administrator` Персона остается в живых и тренирует мост до конца."

