# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **Iteration loop.** The agent MUST follow the [Compose Loop](../agents/action/iteration/compose.md) for every change inside `roles/svc-swarm-node/`, `roles/svc-prx-openresty/` (swarm-mode adaptations), `roles/svc-storage-nfs-server/`, `roles/svc-storage-nfs-client/`, and `roles/web-app-mediawiki/` (pilot). The agent MUST follow the [Workflow Loop](../agents/action/iteration/workflow.md) for every change to `.github/workflows/test-deploy-swarm-nfs.yml`. The agent MUST NOT skip the loop's debug-locally step in favour of remote CI reruns."
msgstr "[ ] **Итерация.** Агент должен следовать за [Композиция Loop](../agents/action/iteration/compose.md) Каждое изменение внутри `roles/svc-swarm-node/`, `roles/svc-prx-openresty/` (приспособления роевого режима), `roles/svc-storage-nfs-server/`, `roles/svc-storage-nfs-client/`, и `roles/web-app-mediawiki/` (пилот)Агент должен следовать за [Рабочий поток](../agents/action/iteration/workflow.md) За каждое изменение в `.github/workflows/test-deploy-swarm-nfs.yml`. Агент не должен пропускать отладочный шаг петли в пользу удаленных повторов CI."

