# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Единственная HTTP поверхность ejabberd `ejabberd_web_admin` на `/admin` (смотреть [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2))Он аутентифицирует голый JID против LDAP по HTTP Basic, поэтому его нет. Keycloak перенаправление для отслеживания и отсутствие контроля входа в приложение для нажатия; аутентификация клиента сама проходит через порты 5222/5269 И остается вне петли драматурга, как отмечается в Watch Points. `acl.admin` Кроме того, в списке указан только администратор JID, поэтому веб-администратор полностью отказывается от любой другой учетной записи. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Поэтому объявляет `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` и `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` Персона и базовые утверждения о достижимости выполняются безоговорочно."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "Эябберд ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI является единственной проверяемой поверхностью Playwright; сам логин клиента XMPP проходит через 5222/5269 и должны быть исполнены одним XMPP- осведомленный клиент за пределами тестовой петли Playwright."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Единственная HTTP поверхность ejabberd ``ejabberd_web_admin`` на ``/admin`` (смотреть ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` Персона и базовые утверждения о достижимости выполняются безоговорочно."

